        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your intuitive understanding of magic allows you to read the energy of a spell in the air. You gain the Analyze Magic spellshift.</p>\n<p><strong>Spellshift—Analyze Magic</strong> Once you've homed in on a spell or magical effect, you can study its unique magical signature to immediately understand exactly what it does.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You learn information about the spell or effect as if you had critically succeeded at a skill check to Identify Magic using the appropriate skill for its magical tradition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You learn information about the spell or effect as if you had succeeded at a skill check to Identify Magic using the appropriate skill for its magical tradition.</p>"
        },
